  "step_3": "In Step 1, the decision reason requires consideration of the sum of pairwise differences of outcomes between the lotteries. The individual did not consider any such differences. The report focuses solely on the absence of loss in Lottery B due to the negligible 1% chance of 0 Euros. There is no mention of comparing outcomes (e.g., 2500 vs 2400, 0 vs 2400), nor of summing differences. The justification is based on a different reasoning — risk aversion or simplification of the outcome space — not on the sum of outcome differences. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The information considered by the individual (only the positive outcomes of B) is not aligned with the required analysis of pairwise differences. The rule of the decision reason (preferring the lottery with the more favorable sum of outcome differences) is not reflected in the justification. Hence, the decision reason was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
